--[[
    Stand Command Script (LocalScript) - Full Version (Modified V7 - Expanded Client Commands)

    Listens for chat messages from a specific target player and performs actions
    based on commands they type. This script runs on your client (locally).
    Handles commands directly or prefixed with "/e ". Arguments are space-separated.
    Supports partial, case-insensitive player names for target commands.

    Commands:
    -- Movement & Teleport --
    .goto [player/partial] /e goto [player/partial] - Teleports to target (or specified/partially named player).
    .follow [player/partial]/e follow [player/partial]- Walk-follows the target (or specified/partially named player).
    .fly [player/partial]  /e fly [player/partial]  - Flies behind/looking at target (or specified/partially named player) (noclip on).
    .orbit [player/partial]/e orbit [player/partial]- Orbits the target (or specified/partially named player) (noclip off).
    .bang [player/partial]/e bang [player/partial] - VISUALLY moves behind target player rapidly (no physical effect on target).
    .unfollow      /e unfollow      - Stops ALL movement modes (follow, fly, orbit, bang, spin, platformstand) & related effects.
    .unfly         /e unfly         - Alias for .unfollow; stops all movement modes & effects.
    .rejoin        /e rejoin        - Makes you rejoin the current server.

    -- Character Modification --
    .speed [value] /e speed [value] - Sets your walk speed (e.g., ".speed 50").
    .jump          /e jump          - Makes your character jump.
    .hipheight [num]/e hipheight [num]- Adjusts visual hip height (e.g., ".hipheight 0").
    .gravity [num] /e gravity [num] - Sets client-side workspace gravity (e.g., ".gravity 100"). Default is ~196.
    .platformstand /e platformstand - Forces character into PlatformStand state (stun). Use .unfollow to stop.
    .spin [speed]  /e spin [speed]  - Spins your character locally. Use .unfollow to stop.
    .sitwalk       /e sitwalk       - Uses sit animation while moving. Use .refresh to fix.
    .reset         /e reset         - Resets your character.

    -- Appearance --
    .naked         /e naked         - Removes clothing textures (client-side).
    .noface        /e noface        - Removes face decal.
    .animate [id]  /e animate [id]  - Plays animation by Asset ID (e.g., ".animate 507766388").
    .stopanim      /e stopanim      - Stops animation started by .animate.

    -- Environment (Client-Side) --
    .fov [num]     /e fov [num]     - Changes camera Field of View (default 70).
    .day           /e day           - Sets time to day (client-side).
    .night         /e night         - Sets time to night (client-side).
    .fullbright    /e fullbright    - Max brightness, no fog (client-side). Use .refresh to reset lighting.
    .nofog         /e nofog         - Removes fog (client-side).

    -- Utility --
    .fling [player]/e fling [player]- Attempts to fling a player (NOTE: Requires server script, prints message).
]]

